# Mental Modulation: if the target is illegal as it tries to resolve, it doesn't resolve and none of its effects happen - no card is drawn (CR 608.2b, and the
# ruling). In turn 3 Bot1 pays {U} from its Mox Sapphire, targeting Bot2's Llanowar Elves; Bot2 Lightning Bolts its own Elves in response. The spell is
# countered on resolution: Bot1's hand stays at 5 (it was 5 as the spell was cast).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mental Modulation
Island x4
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mental Modulation.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Mental Modulation
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
